# {{appNameBase}} SDK - AI Agent Reference

## Installation

Add to your `Package.swift`:

```swift
dependencies: [
    .package(url: "https://github.com/your-org/{{packageName}}", from: "{{packageVersion}}")
]
```

Then add `{{packageName}}` as a dependency of your target.

## Quick Start

```swift
import {{packageName}}

let client = try {{clientClassName}}(host: "https://api.example.com", accessToken: "your-token")
```

## Authentication

All authentication is handled via `Authenticator` implementations passed to the client constructor.

### Bearer Token

```swift
let authenticator = try BearerAuthenticator(host: "https://api.example.com", token: "your-token")
let client = try {{clientClassName}}(authenticator: authenticator)
```

{{#hasBasicAuth}}
### Basic Auth

```swift
let authenticator = try BasicAuthenticator(host: "https://api.example.com", username: "username", password: "password")
let client = try {{clientClassName}}(authenticator: authenticator)
```

{{/hasBasicAuth}}
{{#hasApiKeyAuth}}
### API Key

```swift
let authenticator = try ApiKeyAuthenticator(
    host: "https://api.example.com", keyParamName: "key-name", apiKey: "key-value", location: .header)
let client = try {{clientClassName}}(authenticator: authenticator)
```

{{/hasApiKeyAuth}}
